  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening the Demersal Working Group of the Fisheries Committee for the Eastern Central Atlantic</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective of the demersal working group is to contribute to the improved management of demersal resources on the Atlantic coast of Africa through assessment of the state of the stocks and fisheries in order to ensure a sustainable use of these resources to the benefit of coastal countries.</narrative>
